<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens against dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened against the dollar on Monday but strengthened slightly against the pound, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a commercial mean rate of 597.7719 to the dollar on Monday from 597.7620 on Friday. Against the pound, the shilling stood at 944.0723 from 975.0404 on Friday.</p>
</text>
